ce many animals corrupted by the curse, each of them with their own unique set of combat skills inspired by their species. Make use of your available resources to defeat them: Alternate between your machete for close combat and your magic staff to deal with far away enemies. Don\u00b4t forget to dodge attacks by using your dash technique, essential to survive the intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694990/extras/fa007186b94fdba2f72222904900a9cf.poster.avif?t=1750547670\" width=232 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694990/extras/fa007186b94fdba2f72222904900a9cf.webm?t=1750547670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694990/extras/bdee38d4bc907b4e78634e05d7b4ff54.poster.avif?t=1750547670\" width=277 height=171 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694990/extras/bdee38d4bc907b4e78634e05d7b4ff54.webm?t=1750547670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating your foes, use the healing ritual to release the animals from the curse, returning them to their original state. However, be careful! Airya will be vulnerable during the ritual, making her an easy target to the attacks of other enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694990/extras/1d353650257a2bb392b78d9f5931be8d.poster.avif?t=1750547670\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694990/extras/1d353650257a2bb392b78d9f5931be8d.webp?t=1750547670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=232 height=176 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694990/extras/6050b185c0bce24e9edff17a1bde86de.poster.avif?t=1750547670\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694990/extras/6050b185c0bce24e9edff17a1bde86de.webp?t=1750547670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=277 height=171 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Snoring Woods and Unravel the Rainforest Secrets:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure through the rainforest and explore the many areas within it, each one with their own set of enemies and unique mechanics. Find new abilities that not only expand the number of options available in combat, but also allow you to explore new areas previously inaccessible to Aiyra.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clash with Brazilian Folklore Creatures in Epic Boss Battles:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area of the Rainforest is inhabited by creatures from Brazilian folklore that are also corrupted by the curse. Face and defeat them in epic battles to be able to free them from the curse using Aiyra\u2019s healing ritual, allowing them to return to their role as protectors of the rainforest, bringing harmony back to it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694990/extras/a595ffdf3e29e98a5f4b5a72589d4b88.poster.avif?t=1750547670\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694990/extras/a595ffdf3e29e98a5f4b5a72589d4b88.webp?t=1750547670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=560 height=433 /></picture></span></p>",
